---
import { Image, getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import artwork from '../../assets/explainers/sketch-objects-light.png';
import darkArtwork from '../../assets/explainers/sketch-objects-dark.png';
const dark = await getImage({src: darkArtwork, width: 1000, format: 'webp'});
---
<figure class="paper-surface objects-plate" id="plate-objects">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration</span>
  <h3>The same product, two things to keep</h3>
  <div class="artwork">
    <picture><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset={dark.src}/><Image src={artwork} alt="A product record points to a separate photograph of a blue mug." widths={[600,1000,1448]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 640px" format="webp" loading="lazy"/></picture>
    <strong class="label record-heading">Database record</strong>
    <strong class="label photo-heading">Object store</strong>
    <dl class="record">
      <div><dt>Name</dt><dd>Blue mug</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Price</dt><dd>20 credits</dd></div>
      <div><dt>In stock</dt><dd>4</dd></div>
      <div class="photo-name"><dt>Photo object name</dt><dd>mug.jpg</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <span class="label arrow-label">Names<br/>the photo</span>
    <span class="label filename">mug.jpg</span>
    <span class="label contents">The photograph’s bytes</span>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The database can answer “which products are in stock?” The object store can return the named photograph. This is one common arrangement; databases can store file contents too.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
 .objects-plate{margin:2rem 0;padding:1.2rem;scroll-margin-top:1rem;font:.8rem/1.6 var(--font-sans)}
 h3{font:500 1.35rem/1.3 var(--font-serif);margin:0 0 1rem}
 .artwork{position:relative;container-type:inline-size;color:#413f38}
 .artwork img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
 .label{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);font:500 clamp(11px,2.65cqw,18px)/1.3 var(--font-serif);text-align:center;white-space:nowrap}
 .record-heading{left:25%;top:22%}.photo-heading{left:76%;top:22%}
 .record{position:absolute;left:9%;top:31%;width:31%;height:33%;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-evenly;font:400 clamp(10px,2.45cqw,16px)/1.25 var(--font-serif)}
 .record div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.3em}.record dt{color:#686458}.record dd{margin:0;font-weight:500}.record .photo-name{display:block}.photo-name dd{margin-top:.25em;color:#256d63}
 .arrow-label{left:51.5%;top:39%;font-size:clamp(10px,2.15cqw,14px)}
 .filename{left:76%;top:74%}.contents{left:76%;top:79%;font-size:clamp(10px,2.2cqw,14px)}
 figcaption{border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);padding-top:1rem;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:.75rem}
 @media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.artwork{color:#e5dfd2}.record dt{color:#bcb5a7}.photo-name dd{color:#8dc8bd}}
</style>
